    "summary": "Amends 002's setup-profile and remote-doctor contract. A profile renders a versioned desired remote-state document covering required checks, extra jobs, code-owner review, merge queue, the review-exception environment and its reviewers, workflow-token defaults, secret names, repository custom properties, and profile identity. doctor --remote compares every field independently and never writes remote state or reads a secret value.\n",
    "title": "A setup profile declares remote desired state and doctor compares it without writing"
